{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-beta05","title":"Buture Beta05 Car Jump Starter 4000A丨EC5 Adapter Included, Power More Devices","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf you've ever walked out to your car and found a dead battery, you know how crucial it is to have a car battery starter on hand. Nobody has time to wait for roadside assistance or hope for a jumpstart from a good Samaritan. That's why investing in a reliable car battery starter like the Buture Beta05 is essential for peace of mind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned to handle all gasoline and 10.0L diesel engines, this versatile car battery starter is a must-have for anyone who wants peace of mind on their journeys.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHigh Efficient Battery Jump Starter\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta05 utilizes the latest QDSP technology, providing 3-5 times the current of traditional jump starters with the same capacity. With a boosted 4000A peak current, this powerful car battery booster can instantly restart 12V dead vehicles, including all gas and 10.0L diesel engines, even in extreme temperatures ranging from -4℉ to 140℉ (-20℃ to 60℃). Supporting more than 1000 recharge cycles, it offers a more convenient and reliable option compared to using another car or roadside service.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBackup Battery Charger Power Bank\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta05 doesn't just jump-start your car; it also serves as a high-capacity power bank. With a 23800mAh battery, it can quickly charge your cell phones, tablets, and other USB devices through its dual USB ports. These ports include USB 1 (5V\/2.4A) and USB 2 (5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A). Additionally, it includes a DC cigarette lighter, allowing you to power car accessories like air pumps and vacuum cleaners. This portable battery jump starter can remain on standby for about 24 months, ensuring you're always backed up with power when you need it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEmergency Flashlights\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis car battery jumper features a bright LED flashlight with three modes: large lighting, strobe, and orange strobe\/SOS. The larger luminous area provides ample light, making it an invaluable tool in emergencies or on adventure trips. The flashlight can operate continuously for up to 48 hours, ensuring you always have a reliable light source in any situation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdvanced Large Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 5\" LCD display on the Buture Beta05 provides clear and concise information about the jump pack's operational status and battery power. The integrated screen design is both modern and functional, featuring rainproof and dustproof capabilities to ensure durability in outdoor conditions. The metal texture edge adds to its durability, making it a reliable companion for any journey.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHassle-free Service\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt Buture, customer satisfaction is a priority. The Beta05 car battery starter comes with a worry-free 36-month warranty and lifetime technical support. Our friendly and efficient service team is always ready to assist you, ensuring that you have the best experience possible with your car battery booster.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure Beta05 Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .beta05-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .beta05-table th, .beta05-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .beta05-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .beta05-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"beta05-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e23800\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (Wh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e88.06\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAll Gas\/10.0L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e9.1 x 5.1 x 3.7\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1.11 kg (2.45 lbs)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-4℉~140℉\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 5V\/2A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1: 5V\/2.4A\u003cbr\u003eUSB 2: 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSupports DC\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (160W MAX with EC5)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e3 modes: Large Lighting\/Strobe\/Orange Strobe\/SOS\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eForced Start\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (smart clamps)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDisplay Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (large)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAccessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSmart Clamps x1\u003cbr\u003eEC5 Adapter x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eEVA Case x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492423033087,"sku":"Beta05","price":89.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-jump-starter-beta05.jpg?v=1748244136","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/buture-jump-starter-beta05","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}